    deepLimit: "Precommitment is not a prison for every desire. It is for the moments where the later cost is real and the hot self has a record of bad math.",
    fullScene: "Pilar stands in the grocery aisle at 6:12 p.m., hungry enough to smell the sugar on the cereal boxes. At noon she packed a list: rice, eggs, spinach, soap. Now a family-size pastry tray sits at eye level with a red sale tag. Her noon self feels preachy. The tray feels immediate.",
    fullMechanism: "Arousal compresses time. Hunger, anger, lust, fear, and thrill pull the future closer or push it away, depending on what the hot state wants. Plans made in calm air sound stiff once the body changes.",
